{"id":"c4267d89593cf1f4","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-cyclicpi.md","title":"Local cyclic-function convention","display":"df-cyclicpi — Local cyclic-function convention","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-cyclicpi","aliases":["27-df-cyclicpi"],"display":"df-cyclicpi — Local cyclic-function convention","verification_status":"local-definition-no-book-terminology-match","source_note":"The book definition of essential prime implicants is used; cyclic-function naming is a local convention, not a located term of this book.","depends_on":["[[27-df-corepi]]","[[27-df-constfunc]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-cyclicpi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-cyclicpi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cyclicpi — Local cyclic-function convention"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-no-book-terminology-match"},{"key":"source_note","html":"The book definition of essential prime implicants is used; cyclic-function naming is a local convention, not a located term of this book."},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\)</span> (core prime implicants, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}_n\">\\(\\mathbf{0}_n\\)</span> (constant-zero function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f\\neq\\mathbf{0}_n\\land\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)=\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f\\neq\\mathbf{0}_n\\land\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)=\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本地保留的命名约定：非零且没有 essential prime implicant 的函数在此称 cyclic。已核对原书 §3.3.2 Definition 3.3（印刷 146／PDF 170）的 essential 概念；本轮未在原书找到以 cyclic 命名此函数类的定义，故不声称该名称出自本书。非零条件与上式保持一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-corepi]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-constfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ (core prime implicants, see [[27-df-corepi]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{0}_n$ (constant-zero function, see [[27-df-constfunc]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CyclicFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid f\\neq\\mathbf{0}_n\\land\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)=\\emptyset\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-cyclicpi|df-cyclicpi — Local cyclic-function convention]]"},{"id":"4146d431b2b74bbf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原段落将其他修订概括为局部构造、绑定、定义域和来源范围说明，并说明 cyclic-function 保留为本地命名。现有相关入口是 [[27-df-cyclicpi]]。附件未提供41个文件的历史名单，因而本摘要不将本次改动倒填为 r2 的改动。"}],"outgoing":["c417c668c09a97ed","35eab4f22873ea23"]}